<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the Asia Cup final</p>
<p>match between Sri Lanka and India on Saturday:</p>
<p>India</p>
<p> S.Ganguly c A.de Silva b Dharmasena	  34</p>
<p> N.Sidhu c Muralitharan b S.de Silva	  10</p>
<p> R.Dravid c Mahanama b Vaas			7</p>
<p> S.Tendulkar c Kalpage b Muralitharan	 53</p>
