<p> Total (for seven wickets, 50 overs)	 239</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-32 2-51 3-59 4-168 5-215 6-225 7-234</p>
<p>Did not bat: V.Prasad, N.Kulkarni</p>
<p>Bowling: Vaas 8-1-32-2, S.de Silva 9-1-44-1 (3w), Dharmasena</p>
