<p>Did not bat: R.Mahanama, L.de Silva, K.Dharmasena,</p>
<p>R.Kalpage, C.Vaas, M.Muralitharan, S.de Silva</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 4-0-43-0 (1nb, 2w), R.Singh 3-0-26-0 (1w),</p>
